        <h1 class="font-serif font-black text-white text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Yapahuwa</h1>
        <p class="text-white/80 mt-2 text-lg">Rock Fortress • 13th-Century Capital • Ornate Stairway • Off the Beaten Path</p>
